# The full cuts. 780 MB of masters, and two of them (Mirage at 121 MB, Amore
# Serpente at 120 MB) are over GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file ceiling, so a push
# carrying them is rejected outright. They belong on a media host — point FULL
# in assets/js/films.js at it.
#
# This does not match assets/films/loops/, which is the 38 MB set of 12s hover
# reels the site actually needs in the repo.
/assets/films/*.mp4

# The behind-the-scenes originals, on the same argument: ~150 MB of camera
# files and WhatsApp-delivered masters at up to 5120px. tools/backstage-prep.mjs
# parks them here and writes the web sizes into assets/backstage/web/, which IS
# committed — 35 MB of derivatives is what the site needs and all it needs.
# Keep your own copy of _src; it is the source the derivatives are rebuilt from.
/assets/backstage/_src/

.DS_Store
node_modules/
